{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":31,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T18:20:14.187359425Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b4a0d11-7943-4a5a-b2d3-286f18fad2ba","comment_uuid":"664e8547-73d5-4cd7-9e44-53d87d5b48d6","author":"y4rr","content":"Result: #1698 is stale-resolved at HEAD and now has explicit CUDA regression coverage. Source evidence: ferrotorch-core/src/tensor.rs try_stride_view and try_stride_view_operation call stride_tricks::validate_bounds before stride_view_unchecked; stride_view_unchecked is private; public as_strided/as_strided_copy/as_strided_scatter validate through validate_bounds. validate_bounds checks shape/stride arity, signed representability, nonempty reachable min/max offsets against storage length, and permits empty views without dereferencing storage, matching the live PyTorch probe for OOB vs empty cases. Added probes in audit_tensor_storage_dtype_invariants.rs: cuda_fallible_stride_view_rejects_oob_before_strided_copy_can_read and cuda_empty_stride_view_allows_arbitrary_offset_without_reading_storage. Test evidence: cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_tensor_storage_dtype_invariants -- --nocapture => 7 passed; cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test audit_tensor_storage_dtype_invariants -- --nocapture --test-threads=1 => 9 passed; cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --lib stride_tricks::tests:: -- --nocapture => 17 passed; cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --lib => 1693 passed. Hygiene: cargo fmt --all --check, git diff --check, and cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --lib --test audit_tensor_storage_dtype_invariants -- -D warnings passed. Follow-up: negative-stride as_strided PyTorch parity is tracked separately as #1970.","created_at":"2026-06-15T18:20:14.184955571Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU