{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":56,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T21:37:43.937658188Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"71ff31d0-98d1-498e-942d-381b5fa24597","comment_uuid":"059504ac-8fb7-4284-a06f-8526e9d996b6","author":"y4rr","content":"Classification: CLASS-S silent contract/API violation. PyTorch SavedVariable captures saved_tensors_hooks at save time, calls pack immediately, stores hook-owned packed data in the graph, and calls unpack when backward reads the saved tensor after the context exits. ferrotorch currently exposes the API but production GradFns call Tensor::saved_for_backward(), which only records a storage version and never reaches pack_saved_tensor/unpack_saved_tensor.\n\nRed probe on HEAD: cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks -- --nocapture\nFailure: production_autograd_saved_tensors_use_pack_and_unpack_hooks panicked at ferrotorch-core/tests/audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks.rs:33: assertion left == right failed: MulBackward must pack both saved forward inputs while hooks are active; left: 0, right: 2.\n\nFix plan: connect Tensor saved-for-backward construction to hook capture, store the unpack hook with the packed saved tensor so backward does not depend on ambient thread-local hooks, cover output-saved nodes, preserve in-place version checking for no-hook saves, and add tests for pack/unpack timing plus hook error/pack mutation behavior where feasible.","created_at":"2026-06-15T21:37:43.935058850Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA8FTRzssv4j6A9RfUTHKb1E18LF79X2rR/EFV7Y5hTYY9g+u595Hr+QkMkRaw0uvkBrChk2uefgTTjdNElhg7CQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKm1PgsiB4D/XlOtIhBGpTqfzDdsaHUGcTSi3HLsRzEBwYosWqA82q8a2j45DvopdmQVqE9O71BbppE80wAlkAk="}
{"agent_id":"y4rr","agent_seq":57,"timestamp":"2026-06-15T21:56:04.837021513Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"71ff31d0-98d1-498e-942d-381b5fa24597","comment_uuid":"f2d37189-5f1e-4b3d-a8c8-54b8aa609e72","author":"y4rr","content":"Fixed CORE-023 saved-tensor hooks.\n\nRed probe observed before fix:\n- Command: cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks -- --nocapture\n- Failure: production_autograd_saved_tensors_use_pack_and_unpack_hooks panicked at ferrotorch-core/tests/audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks.rs:33: assertion left == right failed; left: 0, right: 2. Production MulBackward saved two tensors but pack hooks were never called.\n\nImplementation summary:\n- Tensor::saved_for_backward is now fallible and captures the active hook pair at save time.\n- Saved tensors keep original autograd metadata for traversal/requires_grad decisions while storing a packed payload plus an unpack hook for later backward access.\n- Accessors used by backward (data/data_vec/gpu_handle/into_storage_and_shape) lazily unpack saved payloads after the hook scope exits.\n- Pack hooks run under no_grad and error if they mutate their input in place, matching PyTorch SavedVariable behavior.\n- from_operation_saving_output routes saved forward outputs through the same hook path.\n- Hook storage now covers f32, f64, bf16, and f16 instead of silently ignoring half/bfloat saved tensors.\n\nGreen verification:\n- cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks -- --nocapture: 5 passed\n- cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks -- --nocapture: 6 passed, including CUDA offload-to-CPU and restore-to-CUDA with gradients remaining CUDA-resident\n- cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --lib: 1705 passed\n- cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core018_saved_tensor_versions: 17 passed\n- cargo test -p ferrotorch-core --test audit_core054_repeat_tile_zero: 8 passed\n- cargo fmt: clean\n- cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --all-targets -- -D warnings: clean\n- cargo clippy -p ferrotorch-core --features gpu --test audit_core023_saved_tensors_hooks -- -D warnings: clean","created_at":"2026-06-15T21:56:04.767821241Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAndRgq3DBQ0TOpMloR+6Gi2y9OTeT2mcbHsveFpQT/nhNN+ebQYy2cNDvHJF/8sHYvc7HIgxW7DIKRcc1T/elDw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:YWYNpJtV657L1tj0WNsAvmVQrz2HbQJv93mZZEx602c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/HKsBzj3mGAfTiSH5AbOUsF4b5ilHAPc85gQwD/Zjt8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJevHSu6yZuhg9Yva25aDX1XCB/hZ0cVSguBtSoAswuFHpZE5nbP8Y8PVQWISdIpZPPjSZ6qw+mFUxBYNyfLbgI="}
